# Vite serves the frontend over devUrl (http://localhost:5173) with hot-module
# reload, so frontend edits update the running window live. Without this ignore,
# `tauri dev` watches the whole crate — including frontend/ — and does a full
# Rust rebuild + app restart on every frontend change (which also yanks the
# window onto the active macOS Space). Ignore the frontend so only Rust changes
# trigger a rebuild; frontend changes are handled by HMR.
frontend/
